### Register a new user
POST https://localhost:7153/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "phoneNumber": "+1234567890",
  "location": "Test City"
}

### Login with username
POST https://localhost:7153/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "testuser",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### Login with email
POST https://localhost:7153/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "test@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### Verify token (requires Authorization header)
POST https://localhost:7153/api/auth/verify-token
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

### Example of accessing protected endpoint (replace with actual token)
GET https://localhost:7153/api/users
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE 